    "The 50 left are what a deletion pass decided to keep, and they fall in four kinds.",
    "1. Recorded orphans with an owner. ContextIngestionService, i18n/constants and",
    "   acp/history/sqliteModule are in tests/unit/architecture/presentationParityManifest.ts",
    "   with a reason and an owner outside this migration. Check that manifest before",
    "   deleting anything here - one of them was deleted and restored for this reason.",
    "2. Exported so a test can reach them, deliberately. classifyForPresentation says so",
    "   in its own doc comment; resetAntigravityCliCapabilitiesCache is how a test isolates",
    "   a module cache. Removing either makes a test worse, not the source better.",
    "3. Shapes: types re-exported by a barrel, and the Codex app-server wire types kept as",
    "   documentation of a protocol. Deletable, and each needs a reader who knows whether",
    "   the shape is still the wire's.",
    "4. Helpers with no caller that may be lost wiring rather than dead code. This",
    "   migration has already found one of those - a normalizer deleted as dead that two",
    "   providers needed - so each wants reading, not a sweep.",
    "",
    "Removing an entry is always allowed. Adding one needs a reason in the commit."
